lculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Okaloosa County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 53%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 26% on the middle of the grids. Grid 12473 had its driest year in 1954, at 48% of normal.</p>"}
